# Optional. The LLM sense helper is the last vote for APPLY vs ABSTAIN on a
# single surviving candidate (decide/llm_helper.py) — it never finds names
# and never writes SQLite. Leave KIVI_LLM_API_KEY empty to run ungated: every
# cheap door still applies (no_memory, conflicting_canonicals, low_confidence,
# already_canonical), but a surviving candidate APPLYs without a sense check.
# That means a homograph like Groww/grow or kiwi/Kivi WILL rewrite in every
# sentence without a key. See README "LLM sense helper" and RUN.md.

KIVI_LLM_API_KEY=
KIVI_LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
KIVI_LLM_MODEL=google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free
